@startuml
' DS-02 — technical verification interaction; not another user goal or CU branch.
title DS-02 · RNF-02 read-only observation\nTest harness scope, not CU-01 flow coverage
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
hide footbox
participant TestHarness as INF_Test
participant InMemoryCatalog as INF_Catalog
boundary QuoteRequestPort as B_Port
INF_Test -> INF_Catalog : snapshot() <<synchCall>>
INF_Catalog --> INF_Test : deep copy of catalog state before <<reply>>
INF_Test -> B_Port : handle(sameRequestAtSameInstant) <<synchCall>>
B_Port --> INF_Test : success or refusal result <<reply>>
INF_Test -> INF_Catalog : snapshot() <<synchCall>>
INF_Catalog --> INF_Test : deep copy of catalog state after <<reply>>
note over INF_Test
  Compare before/after snapshots and the unchanged request.
  Repeat the same call, compare both outputs to the literal oracle.
  Actual executable assertions are in the reference tests.
  This interaction does not claim that an empty order repository proves no order.
end note
@enduml
